<#ffc828>EMBER CELICA AMMO (X)</>
Reload		^X
  Short reload that leaves her open. Shells come back one by one,
  the more she is missing the longer it takes. Rage reloads faster.
Shells (HUD bar, bottom of the screen)		6 shells
  Every shot below spends 1 shell and cannot be used at 0.
  EX moves, supers and melee moves cost no shells.

<#ffc828>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her open.
Grab / Air grab / Running grab		^Y / ^Y (air) / ^Y (while running)
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Guard Cancel (1 bar, while blocking)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
Double Jump		_U (in the air)
  Air normals cancel into the double jump on hit or block.
Rage		automatic
  Below 35% life: flaming hair, buffed moves, extra hits on her
punches and faster reloads.

<#ffc828>NORMALS (light > medium > heavy)</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Cancel on hit or block, always upward: A > B > C.
  C is her spin kick (the old 5AAAA ender). No knockdown; cancels into 2B or a special (214, 236).
Lunge (old heavy)		_D_D^C
Crouch Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
  Crouching normals mix into the same string (5A > 2B).
Launcher (old 5BB)		_F^B  /  _D^B
  Launches. Cancel into air A (or double jump), then air A > B > C.
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C (air)
  Air C is the same lunge as the ground 22C (a short dash into the kick). It is the finisher.
Standard route		^A ^B _D^B  jump ^A ^B ^C
  Specials cancel from any normal that connected.

<#ffc828>SPECIALS (1 shell each marked *)</>
Fire Cracker *  /  Bottle Rocket * (air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
  Fireball. A = angled down, B = flatter.
Burst of Embers (once per combo)		_D_DB_B^A
Rising Fire *		^A (during Burst of Embers)
Too Hot to Handle *		^B (during Burst of Embers)
Fire Sweep *		_D^B (during Burst of Embers)
Cold Shoulder		_D_DB_B^B
Strawberry Sunrise (reversal)		_F_D_DF^C
  Invincible start, air unblockable on the ground. Free.
  Usable in the air, and as a cancel on hit or block.

<#ffc828>EX MOVES (500 meter, no shells)</>
EX Fire Cracker / EX Bottle Rocket (air)		_D_DF_F^C
Perfect Bombshell		_D_DB_B^C
Raging Inferno		^C (during Burst of Embers)

<#ffc828>SUPERS</>
Burning Gold (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Unrelenting Fire (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
  Start-up armor.
Yellow Dragon (5 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Start-up invincible. The last hit no longer kills outright.
